{"v":4,"catch":"捕捉深海生物的大作戰！\n將相鄰的相同生物全部捕捉的益智類遊戲。","desc":"這個遊戲是一款捕捉所有相鄰的、2個以上的生物的益智遊戲。當畫面中的生物減少時，會從畫面右側補充新的生物，如果捕捉順利，遊戲可以永遠進行下去。\n\n在特殊模式中，有妨礙的方塊和可以起到幫助作用的道具等等追加要素。\n\n還有可以將生物變成簡單的圖像的改編模式。","publisher":"SUCCESS","release":"2024-08-01","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","學習","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","葡萄牙文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fc57088ad0f7cdaf15710f69b840c4dc15e56fb06fa49a6092d936e0e5006c4a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5572a60fed607cb701cce79f6ec6142b09fa70ad327c49279ae52351f2ad0e0b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21a90173818f60f263c5347997e0616452df501950eb4f92af7c647ffe0d6df5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86d72bde1f3b0b09c06173ef85b9c71c76308cfcf9e897580e410eb629b4f547.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d5c0c7295f6eacffa09c14f8c5f185cc5fbb2fe3e474b5ca9cfc9d1cab204c2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4efc1de08a92ff35da1dd36903dd596fa63b93db5e443394e210aa2d3ea994b1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100af601fbf8000","dlc":[]}